{
  "id": "01",
  "title": "引擎宣言 (Manifesto)",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12) 0%, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FBBF24\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**Photon** 是 Gravito 銀河系架構的高效能 HTTP 核心。專為 **Bun 原生運行時** 量身定制，它透過 **Proxy-less 上下文架構** 與亞微秒級調度，實現了真正的 **絕對零開銷**。</p></div><h2>核心哲學</h2><p>Photon 不僅僅是另一個框架；它是高密度工程設計的結構化體現。我們透過移除動態代理 (Proxy) 攔截，以「指令級精確度」取代了通用的抽象化，確保您的應用程式在啟動與運行時都能保持極速。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"m17 7-5-5-5 5\"/><path d=\"m17 17-5 5-5-5\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">BUN_原生優化</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">直接針對 Bun 的 C++ 核心進行優化。具備零拷貝操作、原生 WebSocket 以及極輕量級的內部機制。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><path d=\"M15 3v18\"/><path d=\"M3 15h18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AOT_矩陣</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">路由與中介軟體被預先編譯為 AOT 矩陣，完全消除了運行時的樹狀結構遍歷開銷。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(251,191,36,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">型別之盾</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">無需運行時 Shim 代碼的絕對型別安全。在編譯階段即完成契約驗證，無額外開銷。</p></div></div><h2>銀河系佈局 (The Galaxy Layout)</h2><p>Photon 位於 Gravito 生態系統的基礎層，提供了連接 Orbit、Satellite 與客戶端 (Client) 的原子傳輸層。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 4px; padding: 40px; margin: 40px 0; position: relative;\"><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-technical); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FBBF24;\">@GRAVITO/CORE</span> <span style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px;\">L4_核心編排層</span></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #FBBF24; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\"><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-technical); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-heading);\">@GRAVITO/PHOTON</span> <span style=\"color: #FBBF24; font-size: 10px;\">L3_HTTP_核心 (目前位置)</span></div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px;\"><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@BEAM (RPC)</div><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@ION (SPA)</div><div style=\"border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 10px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted);\">@SENTINEL (授權)</div></div></div><div style=\"background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FBBF24; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 引擎規格：零外部依賴 (ZERO_EXTERNAL_DEPS)</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Photon 堅持「零生產依賴」的立場。每一位元組都為效能而生，確保您的應用程式不會繼承舊有 Node.js 生態系統的技術債務。</p></div><h2>效能指標</h2><p>在標準化硬體上與傳統引擎的吞吐量對比。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FBBF24; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_BUN_優化實例</span> <span>116,495 RPS</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: #FBBF24; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(251,191,36,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>EXPRESS_NODE_JS</span> <span>約 12,000 RPS</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 10%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 指標：PHOTON 在高併發場景下提供 10 倍以上的吞吐量</p></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #FBBF24; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**架構師洞察：** 大多數框架為了維持後向相容性，在各層次都做了妥協。Photon 是為未來而建的。透過將 Bun 原生邊界作為我們的基準線，我們重新定義了高密度後端系統的可能性。</p></div>",
